{
  // The "name" field is INERT in 1.20.1 -- the pool is addressed by its PATH, which is what
  // DungeonStructure#roomStartPool builds: rooms/<motif>/<stratum>/normal. Kept only because
  // every other pool in this pack carries it.
  "name": "dungeons2:rooms/classic/deepslate/normal",
  // minecraft:empty, like every other room pool here. A jigsaw that finds nothing to place
  // self-converts through its final_state rather than falling back to another pool.
  "fallback": "minecraft:empty",
  // Tried AHEAD of rooms/classic/normal for any floor the deepslate band covers, and silently
  // skipped if this file is absent -- see DungeonStructure#chooseRoomStartPool. Note the tier
  // is selected on containsKey, so an EMPTY elements list here would win the tier and then
  // place nothing: a silent structural break. Do not leave this file with no entries.
